<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="KR5e0001-en-1821af28" type="transl"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>Translation of 太平經鈔 into (English)</title><editor role="translator">AI - Gemini</editor></titleStmt><publicationStmt><ab>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</ab><availability status="2"><ab>This work has been licensed for use in the TLS</ab></availability></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title/>2025</bibl><ab>Translation of <bibl corresp="#KR5e0001"><title xml:lang="och">太平經鈔</title></bibl> into <lang xml:lang="en">English</lang>.</ab></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation resp="#CH">Initially created: <date>2025-07-07T03:08:36.792+09:00</date> by CH</creation></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Translated parts</head><p xml:id="KR5e0001-start"><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.371" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">Thus, correct writings and correct words</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.372" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">are the true root and great efficacy for heaven, earth, the people, and all things.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.373" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">If you wish to greatly clarify and know its trustworthiness,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.374" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">it is like people praising each other before the ruler with correct writings and correct words.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.375" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">The ruler can then be considered greatly intelligent and greatly wise.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.376" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">All undertakings will be successful,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.377" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">with no loss of correctness.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.378" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">Those above and below will then obtain the heart and mind of heaven and earth.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.379" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">The three luminaries (sun, moon, and stars) will not lose their movements,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.380" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">the four seasons and five elements will not be disordered,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.381" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">the people will all be joyful,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.382" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">all saying "Good indeed!"</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.383" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">All things will each obtain their proper place.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.384" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">Kindness will extend to the gods,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.385" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">then the name will be heard in distant lands.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.386" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">The multitude of gods will respond with auspicious omens and strange objects will emerge out of joy.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.387" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">All worthy scholars in the world will gladly come to assist their ruler,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.388" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">not acting secretively.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.389" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">Immortals and deities will then bring the methods of immortality and give them to him.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.390" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">Demons and wicked forces will be annihilated.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.391" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">The people will be governed accordingly.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.392" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">When correct writings and correct words are spoken, there will be no more mutual hatred and malice,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.393" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">then grievances and resentments will be eliminated.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.394" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">All good in the world will emerge,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.395" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">all evil will be hidden.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.396" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">The virtuous ruler need only fold his hands and govern himself,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.397" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">what worry will there be of danger and destruction?</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.398" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:12:22.812+09:00">This is the clear proof and efficacy that my correct writings and correct words are the root of goodness.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.399" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">Is this not a vigorous rectification?</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.400" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">Does the Perfected One understand?"</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.401" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">"Yes, yes.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.402" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">How frightening!</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.403" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">Seeing the Celestial Master's words,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.404" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">I have already greatly awakened,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.405" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">and this foolish one knows that the world is already at peace.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.406" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">If the virtuous ruler listens and employs them,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.407" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">he will prolong his life."</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.408" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">"Excellent!</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.409" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">You can be called a student who understands affairs,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.410" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">and already fully understands it.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.411" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">Joyful, joyful!</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.412" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">Heaven's worries have already been resolved,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.413" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">earth's sickness has already been removed,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.414" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">how does the Perfected One know this?"</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.415" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">"Indeed,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.416" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">all these evils should be seen gone,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.417" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">and the great sickness of heaven, earth, the people, and all things has already been removed.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.418" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">Now, it has already been restrained and compared with the correct texts and correct words,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.419" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">therefore I know that the great sickness of heaven and earth has already been removed."</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.420" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">"Excellent, excellent!</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.421" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">You have already □□ understood it.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.422" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">If the emperor vigorously practices my words,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.423" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">and is generous to heaven and earth,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.424" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">there will be no more disasters.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.425" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">Excellent, excellent!</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.426" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">These are important words to the Perfected One.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.427" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">If the ruler of supreme virtue obtains my words,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.428" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">heaven will use the law of images to employ officials,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.429" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">from the highest spiritual man,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.430" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">down to the smallest and most lowly,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.431" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">all these nine men.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_006-48a.432" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-07-08T00:13:00.871+09:00">Spirit, Perfected,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-4a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-4a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">Thoughts can lead to righteousness</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-4a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">, and can also lead to evil</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-4a.4" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">, all arising from one's will and intention.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-4a.5" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">They can move Heaven and Earth,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-4a.6" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">harmonize Yīn and Yáng,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-4a.7" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">unite all things.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-4a.8" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">Inwardly, they can measure the body;</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-4a.9" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">outwardly, they can achieve fame.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-4a.10" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">Both the virtuous and the unworthy arise from this.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-4a.11" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">Therefore, the virtuous are good at controlling them [thoughts],</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-4a.12" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">and will not err even once in ten thousand times.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-4a.13" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">"Why is it that when a person has transgressions in their heart,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-4a.14" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">their face turns red?"</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-4a.16" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">"The heart is</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-4a.17" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">the master of the five viscera;</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-4a.18" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">the master is also the king.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-4a.19" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">The king is in charge of upholding righteousness,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-4a.20" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">and having transgressions is like reporting to Heaven."</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-4a.21" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">"Why is it that when one is frightened,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-4a.22" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">the face turns green?"</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-4a.23" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">"The liver is the host,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-4a.24" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">and to be human is to have worries.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-4a.25" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">When the liver and gallbladder react to anger,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-4a.26" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">thus it manifests as green on the face."</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-4a.27" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">All spirits have something they can govern,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-4a.28" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">so as to correspond with all things.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-4a.29" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">Therefore, it is important to always be careful and good,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-4a.30" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">and to comply with Heaven and Earth,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-4a.31" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">so that calamities cannot arise again.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-5a.1" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00"/><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-5a.2" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">There is much external learning,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_010-5a.3" xml:lang="en" resp="#gemini-2.0-flash" modified="2025-10-18T21:27:00.435+09:00">but little internal learning.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.494" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">People, regardless of status, all partake of it.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.495" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">It is the virtuous people (dé rén) who receive Heaven's mandate (tiān tǒng),</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.496" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">manifesting Heaven's pattern (tiān xíng).</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.497" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">On earth, they provide food for the people (mín shí),</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.498" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">spreading kindness and generosity.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.499" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">No one is untouched by their virtue,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.500" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">thereby satisfying themselves.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.501" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">This is not true heavenly grace (tiān ēn).</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.502" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">What Heaven bestows and nurtures is immensely great,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.503" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">yet [people] do not obey the mandate,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.504" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">but instead attribute things to 'naturalness'.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.505" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">This is an affront.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.506" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">Therefore, the virtuous people (dé rén) are made to understand Heaven's will (tiān yì) from above,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.507" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">teaching the people to establish practices,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.508" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">without losing sight of Heaven's heart (tiān xīn),</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.509" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">nurturing them to grow and mature,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.510" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">so they may become proper human beings.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.511" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">Furthermore, they come to understand the principles of civilization,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.512" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">perfect their conduct and attain virtue,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.513" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">and may thus ascend to the ranks of heavenly beings (tiān shì).</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.514" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">As for matters in Heaven,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.515" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">merits and achievements have their distinctions.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.516" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">Virtuous people (dé rén) are primarily responsible for the affairs of the earth,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.517" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">causing the people to rely on and look up to them,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.518" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">and repeatedly witness their bestowed grace.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.519" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">Yet [the people] are unable to repay them in due time.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.520" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">Virtuous people (dé rén) act as Heaven's agents in circulating vital energy (qì),</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.521" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">pervading above, below, and the center.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.522" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">If this vital energy does not reach its proper place,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.523" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">people, on the contrary, lightly regard what Heaven bestows and performs.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.524" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">This directly causes Heaven's wrath (tiān nù) to be unending,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.525" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">and the spirits (shén líng) to no longer favor humanity.</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.526" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">They infringe upon and seize people's lifespans,</seg><seg corresp="#KR5e0001_tls_007-53a.527" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-26T18:23:41.52+09:00">and yet [people] themselves complain and wrongly blame Heaven.</seg></p></div></body></text></TEI>